  {
    "find": "a threshold empirical lookup-latency degradation analysis motivates",
    "replace": "a threshold motivated by empirical analysis of how lookup latency degrades",
    "type": "noun-stack",
    "reason": "Four nouns and a postposed verb obscure who motivates the threshold and what the analysis concerns."
  },
  {
    "find": "amortized O(1) access guarantees, which unbounded chain-length growth would otherwise erode",
    "replace": "amortized O(1) access guarantees. Otherwise, unbounded growth in chain length would erode those guarantees.",
    "type": "noun-stack",
    "reason": "'chain-length growth' compresses the relation into stacked nouns, and the relative clause makes the reader work out what would erode what."
  }
]

[
